“Marine Science Day provides an opportunity for ocean and science enthusiasts, young and old alike, to see themselves as part of the Batten School & VIMS’ mission to provide science for solutions." 

@vainstituteofmarinescience's 23rd annual Marine Science Day drew more than 2,000 attendees from across the Commonwealth for a day of hands-on science exploration in Gloucester Point.

Read more about the marquee open house at the link in our bio.
